{"metas":[{"id":"tt0177440","type":"series","name":"Family Feud","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2eY3KyYvvjg2jn2ifTGkwdipCAC.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zhLrML5jLVIlln5QFZdYHgtmFXr.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"1999"},{"id":"tt9877848","type":"series","name":"Happu Ki Ultan Paltan","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQDRiFjJ9rTwv5dmYAqnwovShTn.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/e7fLPGAYO5SagGDsxTxeBBcqSsK.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2019"},{"id":"tt6773088","type":"series","name":"Brothers","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yewGBOuVmcZnMQ60xGGjUhobOsJ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/aLE7R8QZPpTiWZS48PS22i2OWbl.jpg","description":"Matthew McConaughey et Woody Harrelson sont meilleurs amis depuis toujours, mais leur lien pourrait devenir encore plus étroit après la découverte d’un secret de famille troublant.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt37077773","type":"series","name":"Terra Forte","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emDXPQIYkRDvqd3EChIYc39kGmc.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/uDuNd0fHZw1qfIK6AY4Nh3WWIsu.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2025"},{"id":"tt34541065","type":"series","name":"Les Alliés","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsipinibYxrZhpkQ6MKxIMgL0hv.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/xIDN1hQT5l3HZxX2KLvcOXPqa3t.jpg","description":"Dans cette émission, les participants forment des équipes pour accumuler un maximum de points lors de jeux et de défis.\n\nChaque membre de l'équipe victorieuse à la fin du mois a une chance de remporter 100 000 €, mais ce prix ne peut revenir qu'à un seul vainqueur final ; ils finissent donc par s'affronter entre eux. À l'inverse, les membres de l'équipe ayant obtenu les moins bons résultats à la fin du mois risquent de repartir les mains vides. Ainsi, deux candidats sont éliminés chaque mois, mais deux nouveaux venus rejoignent le groupe pour les remplacer.","releaseInfo":"2023"},{"id":"tt20722888","type":"series","name":"Vandaag Inside","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEFfIcHzlxiYw8e6hXRCqskSKsG.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/6RGenKnUe7UoEJLRKVAMMq2TWG.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt27564441","type":"series","name":"Dunaj, k vašim službám","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHt0ehVLaHTgN4eulK5T1h0GcmT.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/jOweYy6FWmYm3r93PBF4qsMHTUO.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2023"},{"id":"tt35082595","type":"series","name":"Sľub","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywaHSBDEAgxqjebw5CQoAjISwA5.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/kUbFHFrbVBpo1XiNCczFqfhvRvG.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2025"},{"id":"tt5516894","type":"series","name":"Die Kanzlei","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auY6zgq7OdFcptt9Zci1rJyU6zB.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/6PgtzWu6QQ0RJiJiulDwnpbBcPU.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2015"},{"id":"tt0162076","type":"series","name":"Familie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPBeBzhhfbF0aYZaHd7ESe0TVwK.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/gEXpwUTdyWczjNtOjLPq0REC6Ey.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"1991"},{"id":"tt0170930","type":"series","name":"Fair City","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9t0NRUngEKPa36vrXowjorWrAH.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/u3DZNjaEd2TwPCXeF0xtAVC6eZQ.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"1989"},{"id":"tt31323246","type":"series","name":"Hot Ones Versus","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wqOM8b2aG5fgt2bvqSs7T2L9r5.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/5YaJhfxjKo9nu9R7fGiEziaO3PZ.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2024"},{"id":"tt0058796","type":"series","name":"Des jours et des vies","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Zm7epVFEovMEVLpM6FvrjhaNXn.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/e7MSbwYRVqd4rZQQWcNuJvOSHLC.jpg","description":"A Salem, deux familles, les Horton et les Brady, vivent paisiblement. Derrière ce calme relatif, de multiples passions couvent et des intrigues se nouent…","releaseInfo":"1965"},{"id":"tt15383132","type":"series","name":"CBS Mornings","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLxvqYcHpzC86jfZsYhQf8UGzne.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/88QJHteDz2hsOrylsX7jw8DYANZ.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2021"},{"id":"tt13563720","type":"series","name":"Åsted Norge","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9prgjeaksiRbgqlkrrl3z1rudab.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/sIMbbXRzN3rGkStzlRN61NLTO6i.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2016"},{"id":"tt1626459","type":"series","name":"Ça va chauffer ! Australie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzbSNgNrquLhXpR0M0jihkEFM0m.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3VsO6TVUYN6aeUmrNIXqhuX902t.jpg","description":"Des chefs cuisiniers amateurs d’Australie transforment leur maison en restaurant l’espace d’un soir dans l’espoir d’impressionner les juges avec les meilleurs plats cuisinés maison.","releaseInfo":"2010"},{"id":"tt1933854","type":"series","name":"Made in Chelsea","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99xPXLPqKHcNRYq3fCU7GkHQyQI.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4Xx7wdmv8sWAPyTCST2OkWokaT0.jpg","description":"Cette série de téléréalité suit les vies et les amours d'un groupe de jeunes de la haute société qui vivent dans l'un des quartiers les plus huppés de Londres.","releaseInfo":"2011"},{"id":"tt0306398","type":"series","name":"Star Academy","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26qS8VmB7PgtkkBuA0J20nmTish.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ugcdRKcOyUMAr9hAsL058cAX2vj.jpg","description":"Star Academy est une émission de téléréalité française. Il s'agit d'un concours musical où de jeunes talents suivent des cours axés principalement sur le chant, la danse et l'expression scénique. À la fin de chaque semaine, les jeunes talents participent à un prime en direct et qui se termine en général par l'élimination d'un candidat. Le public vote pour son candidat préféré.","releaseInfo":"2001"},{"id":"tt0439401","type":"series","name":"Strictly Come Dancing: It Takes Two","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zZxmrDBRU1rcUpRN2Wg0iBQ1cw.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/tYyeeZrkDINF91yW2IVqVn33lrt.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2004"},{"id":"tt1536749","type":"series","name":"Let's Make a Deal","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9e2zBDDJNzwKymAWDuLhgViPc06.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ojZdqcOI3PjVfeNAAtLoruT4Fpl.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2009"}]}